                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Beaupré to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-02-08"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 8,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Beaupré reports that the insurrection has been suppressed.)</p>
            </div>
